{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8598-1",
  "summary": "rsyslog vulnerabilities",
  "details": "It was discovered that rsyslog incorrectly handled regex-based TCP framing\nin the imptcp module. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\ncause rsyslog to crash, resulting in a denial of service.\n\nIt was discovered that rsyslog incorrectly handled oversized RFC5424\nstructured data in the mmpstrucdata module. A remote attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause rsyslog to crash, resulting in a denial of\nservice. (CVE-2026-61548)",
